<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-SPANISH FIRST DIVISION LEADING SCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SPANISH FIRST DIVISION LEADING SCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish first division leading</p>
<p>scorers after Sunday's games:</p>
<p>13 - Ronaldo (Barcelona), Davor Suker (Real Madrid)</p>
<p>9 - Jose Ziganda (Athletic Bilbao), Oli Alvarez (Oviedo),</p>
<p>Predrag Mijatovic (Real Madrid)</p>
<p>8 - Julen Guerrero (Athletic Bilbao), Juan Eduardo Esnaider</p>
<p>(Atletico Madrid)</p>
<p>7 - Guilherme (Rayo Vallecano), Gustavo Poyet (Zaragoza),</p>
<p>...   Alfonso Perez (Real Betis).</p>
</text>
